# Tambah cost center / profit center (OPRC) lewat Service Layer. Urut 1 -> 2.
# InWhichDimension = DimCode dari ODIM (dicek 2026-10-15): 1 TYPE, 2 PROCESSING, 3 DEPARTMENT, 4 LOCATION, 5 ZONA.
# Valid From semua 2023-01-01. Satu changeset: kalau satu gagal, semua batal.

@sl = https://192.168.40.197:50000/b1s/v1

### 1. Login
POST {{sl}}/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{"CompanyDB":"CVPPM","UserName":"manager","Password":"1234"}

### 2. Tambah 34 cost center (hasil benar: 34x "HTTP/1.1 201 Created")
POST {{sl}}/$batch
Content-Type: multipart/mixed;boundary=batch_cc

--batch_cc
Content-Type: multipart/mixed;boundary=changeset_cc

--changeset_cc
Content-Type: application/http
Content-Transfer-Encoding: binary

POST /b1s/v1/ProfitCenters
Content-Type: application/json

{"CenterCode":"ADMIN","CenterName":"ADMIN","InWhichDimension":3,"EffectiveFrom":"2023-01-01","Active":"tYES"}

--changeset_cc
